{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297891","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297891","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1029789101:1":{"text":"エルーナがこの木を気に入ったようだ。","source_cn":"艾洛娜很喜欢这棵树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC621C2DD3A5CAC9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029789102:1":{"text":"だから私も、もう数日ここに留まるつもりだ。","source_cn":"所以，我大概会在这里多留几天吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8965E75CFF5DCDFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1029789102":{"text":"だから私も、もう数日ここに留まるつもりだ。","source_cn":"所以，我大概会在这里多留几天吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8965E75CFF5DCDFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029789103:1":{"text":"ライカたちは何度かここに来ているからな。風便りで「気にせず思う存分遊んでこい」と言われた。","source_cn":"莱卡她们此前来玩过几次，所以发来风讯说让我不用在意好好玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6AA0F97124A5123","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029789104:1":{"text":"実際、今までほとんど休暇を取っていなかったからな。","source_cn":"毕竟我几乎不怎么休假。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA31BF1DB99C7DE3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029789105:1":{"text":"この機会に、エルーナと色んな場所を見て回ろうと思う。","source_cn":"这次也算是难得的机会，可以和艾洛娜一起到处游玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DFC7BEE0C40529F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029789106:1":{"text":"そう言えば、「クインが祭りを見逃すはずがないから、見かけたら捕まえて連れ戻してくれ」とライカに頼まれたのだ。","source_cn":"对了，莱卡还让我留意，说洛桑不会错过这种热闹，如果碰到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC9C521866BD71DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029789107:1":{"text":"エルロンも森に戻っているから、この機にみんなで集まりたいのだろう。","source_cn":"毕竟埃隆也回来了，恐怕是想要大家一起聚会吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x576184523286428D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029789108:1":{"text":"いずれにせよ、休暇と人探しを兼ねて、しばらくはここにいることになりそうだな。","source_cn":"总之，休假也好抓人也罢，这段时间，我应该都会在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FD1E46060CCD99E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"ユグドラシルの方はいいのか？","source_cn":"薄暮丛林那边怎么办？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1E805161B3DB519F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"ユグドラシルの方はいいのか？","female":"ユグドラシルの方はいいの？","variant_male_record_index":"60364","variant_female_record_index":"60365","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat